    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "How far is County Hillock?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Leader'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#7",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Far.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "My sister must have known...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Leader'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#7",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only The Elocutionist and his band of idiots would consider this plan flawless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#6",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then why are you still following me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Leader'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, believe me, if it were up to me I'd be taking a nap in camp right about now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why didn't my sister stop me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Leader'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know. Maybe she has high hopes for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, that's impossible. She's never looked at me like that. When I agreed to be her shadow, she...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Leader'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, Harmonie... tell her I don't want to do this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Leader'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#7",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That you don't want to go to County Hillock?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm. And if she's in a good mood, could you also tell her that, from now on, I'll\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Leader'"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Leader'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, never mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Leader'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, can't hurt to pass it along, I suppose. Although it's not easy avoiding The Elocutionist's eyes and ears.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you. You should go...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Leader'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_226_weed_1#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...before she gets bored.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Leader'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
