        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "59_g15_castlebalcony_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$eblana_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She deceived you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, she didn't deceive anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She set this all up, knowing you would never allow the entire city to die with her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She baited you into piercing her vessel, freeing her from her bonds and allowing the purple fire to spread, burning us all to ashes on the eve of Samhain!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would she take such a risk for a festival that she never cared about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm affected by the purple flames too. I can feel the flames of death burning in my chest, colder than ever. So cold I'm growing number by the minute!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter whether she's seeking dominion over all of Tara, or if she's simply gone mad and wants the city to die with her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's neither. Tara already belongs to her, and she was very much lucid. She...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nemos, is her body still there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go check.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
