        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "300,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The wayward wakewoman's brow is furrowed. Perhaps she has never felt such malice in all her life, and as such has never harbored such resolve."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her body is\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The sound of burning drowns out her answer."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever she's trying to do, Na Saoirs\u00ed is not fully gone. The fire-returning ceremony can still go on... it <i>must</i> go on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm well aware.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll inform the citizens that the wicked red dragon they worshipped is dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about Brigid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've asked her to leave the city and find the wakemen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And how are you going to tell people that Eblana is dead?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "With a coffin. That seems appropriate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even coffins are in short supply, but she is not some nameless nobody. She deserves one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is something wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. I'm simply realizing how ugly the path she walked is, a path that even now waves at me invitingly... And it's an invitation I have no choice but to accept.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go, Nemos. I will buy you some time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean from the dark mist?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. If it wants to be a part of the Samhain festivities, I will keep it at bay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can hardly wait to ask the mist how to return the Red Dragon's flame to darkness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noble Red Dragon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
