        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_snowconutryinside",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$darkness_03_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "'I can hardly wait to ask the mist how to return the Red Dragon's flame to darkness.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you feel about that line?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, the ending of the dragon and her reflection is clear enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_chairbump",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The writer stands up with a start."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are you and what do you want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I want is to finish the story that you would not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you say I was the type who liked to piece together the truth? We've gotten so very close to it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is enough. I'm leaving\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you won't tell the ending yourself, I suppose it falls on me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "<i>Suddenly, someone opened their eyes, causing a surprised reflection to let go of her hand. The dragon fell into the fire burning bright, and the reflection hid back in the mirror.</i>",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "<i>When the fire subsided, the dragon was gone, and the people were anxious, for they could not find their dragon.</i>",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "<i>The reflection wanted to explain, find a way to bring the dragon back. Without the dragon, though, she could no longer leave the mirror.</i>",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been glancing over there at the newspapers. But not everything reported is a fact.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "The writer looks towards the door."
    },
    {
        "text": "He tries to imagine himself running out of the tavern, but it is such a preposterous proposition that he almost laughs out loud."
    },
    {
        "text": "If not everything reported is a fact, then he finally knows who this woman is, and why she is here."
    },
    {
        "text": "He also knows that there is no escape."
    },
    {
        "text": "But there is something else he realizes."
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps this is his chance to truly find the ending he had hoped for."
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter who she is, as long as the story continues, they are equals."
    },
    {
        "text": "He feels his spirit return."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay. I don't care who you are, or why you're here, but that's no way to tell a story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "text": "You haven't given it an ending. All you did was extend an ending-less story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I have to know\u2014did you... really see a red dragon kill another?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the same sense that you saw the hero drag a giant metal skeleton to the square. A creative liberty, nothing more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then take responsibility for it. So the dragon in the mirror accidentally caused her other self to burn to death in the fire. What next? What did the people do? What about the dragon in the mirror?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you? Don't you have any ideas of your own?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "For the first time in a long while, the writer takes out a fountain pen from his pocket, then grabs one of the playing cards on the table. He tries to write something, but the tip of the pen has dried out from disuse."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need... time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if it can be connected... then maybe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Connected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me guess. You're talking about the last story that you published?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The writer's pen scratches hard against the card. Finally, some ink oozes out of the tip."
    },
    {
        "text": "He is suddenly reminded of the words of Seamus Williams\u2014'May death connect us with all legends.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seamus Williams is dead. But he himself might\u2014if he may be so impertinent\u2014have a chance to be connected with the legends he wrote."
    },
    {
        "text": "He tries to scribble the poem on the card, but the pen leaves only broken, illegible ink trails."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just maybe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_chairrub",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The writer sits back on the chair, his back even straighter than before."
    },
    {
        "text": "He suddenly feels an urge, the same one he felt after hearing a Seamus Williams poem for the first time."
    },
    {
        "text": "The same feeling that had taken him down this wretched path, which seizes his chest and makes him want to sing, to yell\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "To create."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may have indeed solved a problem for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "text": "As I said, what I've seen, what I believe, and what I've said all contradict one another. Thanks to you, though, they are finally beginning to converge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "How lovely for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, are you ready to start telling the third story?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course... of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'll need your help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will need to pick up the narrative whenever I get stuck.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1698_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is my story, but it's also yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "text": "It has always been yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Writer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "With pleasure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper2",
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The writer's breathing is rapid, his face red. His fountain pen still refuses to write, so he throws it on the table."
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Of course."
    },
    {
        "text": "Has he not seen enough of those things already?"
    },
    {
        "text": "So what?"
    },
    {
        "text": "He is a writer. He will soon find the ending of his story."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
